---
title: "What should y do in the questions modal?"
accTitle: "Questions copy key flow"
accDescr: "Today y copies every question and answer at once. The proposal opens the existing Copy as palette so a second key copies an agent snippet, a derived path, or a built-in such as all Q and A."
config:
  layout: dagre
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 12
    nodeSpacing: 12
    wrappingWidth: 200
---
flowchart TD
  subgraph TODAY["Today"]
    direction TB
    Y1["`**y key**`"]
    ALL1["`**Clipboard**<br/>all questions and answers`"]
    Y1 -->|copies immediately| ALL1
  end
  subgraph PROPOSED["Proposed"]
    direction TB
    Y2["`**y key**`"]
    PAL["`**Copy as palette**`"]
    KEY{{"`**Second key?**`"}}
    SNIP["`**Agent snippet**<br/>keys 1 to 9`"]
    PATH["`**Derived path or URL**<br/>keys p and u`"]
    BUILTIN["`**Built-in**<br/>y all Q and A, s snapshot`"]
    Y2 ==>|opens| PAL
    PAL --> KEY
    KEY -->|"1 to 9"| SNIP
    KEY -->|p or u| PATH
    KEY -->|y or s| BUILTIN
  end
  ALL1 -.->|"replace"| Y2
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  classDef decision fill:#FFF7E6,stroke:#C77C02,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#4A3000
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  classDef muted fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6B7280,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1F2937
  class Y1,ALL1 muted
  class Y2,PAL focus
  class KEY decision
  class SNIP,PATH,BUILTIN outcome
  style TODAY fill:none,stroke:#6B7280
  style PROPOSED fill:none,stroke:#3B78C2
